# The Polyline tool on the sketch example: four clicks and a click back on
# the first vertex close a polygon PG1; three clicks and Enter finish a
# polyline PL1 open; two clicks and a right click finish PL2 open; one
# click and Esc drop the next; a second Esc quits the tool.
open docs/instances/sketch-basic.json
wait 16
action tool.polyline
wait 2
click L 708 339
click L 789 339
click L 789 258
click L 708 258
click L 709 340
wait 2
click L 724 363
click L 772 355
click L 740 291
key Enter
wait 2
click L 716 242
click L 797 250
click R 797 250
wait 2
click L 764 283
key Escape
key Escape
wait 2
